 Appointed Mr. Rahul Desai as the new CEO, effective 3rd August, 2026 and Mrs. Shivani Kejriwal as Additional Whole Time Director of the Company w.e.f 16th October, 2026  The Board of Directors have approved exit of Remsons from joint venture agreement in Aircom Remsons Automotive Private Limited.  Remsons Industries Ltd. secured an order from a leading global commercial vehicle OEM for the supply of Hood Rods, with an order value of ₹300 mn to be executed over six years. REMSONS INDUSTRIES LIMITED Page 1 of 4  Remsons Industries Ltd. secured a landmark ₹3,000mn, 7-year order from Stellantis N.V. for the supply of control cables.  BEE Lighting Ltd secured a significant ₹120mn order from a Global Multinational OEM for the design and development of exterior vehicle lighting.  Remsons Automotive Ltd. (UK), was nominated by a global commercial vehicle OEM for a 10-year pedal box programme, with production scheduled to commence in Q4 CY2028. The programme carries an estimated lifetime value of ~₹1600 mn. Management Discussion and Commentary: Performance Overview Revenue from operations grew 17% YoY to ₹1,355 Mn, well above the broader auto-components sector. EBITDA stood at ~₹122 Mn at a ~9% margin (excluding other income), & PAT attributable to shareholders stood at ₹47 Mn, with diluted EPS at ₹1.36. Key Drivers of Growth The engines combined to drive growth well above the industry rate, even against a challenging macroeconomic backdrop characterised by raw material inflation and global trade dislocatio"
